格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Tencent CodeBuddy plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh).","id":"gh:1334078581","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-llm-codebuddy","slug":"shatyuka/dsh-llm-codebuddy","topics":["codebuddy","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Tencent CodeBuddy plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-llm-codebuddy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) plugin for **Tencent CodeBuddy**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Sign in through your browser — **no API key required** — and use CodeBuddy's own model list."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Browser OAuth sign-in** — authorize in a normal browser tab; no API key needed, ever. Sign in to"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" either the China or the international site.\n- **Full model catalog** — CodeBuddy's own models, with"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" context windows, output caps, and credit multipliers; server-side additions and removals are picked"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" up automatically.\n- **Streaming chat** — responses stream in real time.\n- **Tool calls** — function"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" calling, with a clear error when a model does not support it.\n- **Reasoning effort** — pick a think"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ing level for models that support one.\n- **Image input** — attach images for vision-capable models ("},{"id":"p7s7","text":"models without vision support may be routed to a different model by the server).\n- **Usage indicator"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"** — a quota bar in the Web UI sidebar for both personal and enterprise plans, with an optional cust"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"om cap and a configurable danger threshold.\n- **Model arrangement** — reorder the model menu and hid"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"e the models you never use."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Requirement | Version |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) | `>= 0.2.2-rc.1` |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Web UI features such as the settings page, model picker, and usage indicator require the `web` profi"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" UI features such as the settings page, model picker, and usage indicator require the `web` profile."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Add the plugin to a dsh profile — the `web` profile backs the Web UI:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Sign in"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open **Settings → CodeBuddy** in the Web UI and pick a site: **Sign in (China)** for copilot.tencent"},{"id":"p16s2","text":".com or **Sign in (Intl)** for www.codebuddy.ai. The browser login opens in a new tab; the harness w"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"rites the credential automatically. No terminal needed."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The two sites are the same service on different hosts but hold **separate accounts** — one site's ac"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"count does not work on the other — so the site is chosen per sign-in and recorded with the credentia"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"l. Every later request goes to the host that issued it. To move to the other site, sign out and sign"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ater request goes to the host that issued it. To move to the other site, sign out and sign in again."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Alternatively, sign in from the terminal:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Once signed in, CodeBuddy's models appear in the model picker."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Build"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"From a source checkout:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"This compiles the host half with `tsc` and bundles the Web client half with `esbuild`, both into `li"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" compiles the host half with `tsc` and bundles the Web client half with `esbuild`, both into `lib/`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Test"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
